  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5855,
      "text": "No indeed! The record of the wicked is surely in Sijjīn.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5856,
      "text": "How do you know what Sijjīn is?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5857,
      "text": "It is a clearly inscribed Record.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5858,
      "text": "Woe on that Day to the deniers,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5859,
      "text": "those who deny the Judgment Day!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5860,
      "text": "None denies it except every sinful transgressor.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5861,
      "text": "When Our verses are recited to him, he says, “Ancient fables[2]!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5862,
      "text": "No indeed! Their hearts have been stained by what they used to commit[3]!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5863,
      "text": "No indeed! On that Day they will be barred from seeing their Lord[4].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5864,
      "text": "They will then surely enter the Blazing Fire,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5865,
      "text": "then they will be told, “This is what you used to deny.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5866,
      "text": "No indeed! The record of the righteous is certainly in ‘illiyyīn –",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5867,
      "text": "and how do you know what ‘illiyyūn is? –",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5868,
      "text": "It is a record inscribed,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5869,
      "text": "witnessed by those who are close to Allah.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5870,
      "text": "Indeed, the righteous will be in Bliss,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5871,
      "text": "seated on the couches, gazing in wonder.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5872,
      "text": "You will see on their faces the radiance of bliss.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5873,
      "text": "They will be served to drink pure wine from a sealed container,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5874,
      "text": "whose last sip is musk[5] – let those who strive, strive for that –",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5875,
      "text": "and it will be mixed with water from the spring of Tasnīm[6],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5876,
      "text": "a spring from which those who are close to Allah will drink.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5877,
      "text": "Indeed, the wicked used to laugh at the believers;",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5878,
      "text": "when they passed by them, they would wink at one another,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5879,
      "text": "and when they went back to their people, they would return exulting.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5880,
      "text": "When they saw the believers, they would say, “These people are truly misguided,”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5881,
      "text": "although they were not sent as their keepers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 30,
